    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5abda6d7-13a9-51df-b7c2-c35d1a3504f4" activityNameId="9eb7b631-1c10-5f57-8ffa-65e96f5b6ff8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 800, profile 2A</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 800, profile 2A
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: aefe5508-e355-49b9-becf-dd0d79928404
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with polymer concrete pipe. DN 800, profile 2A according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with polymer concrete pipe, DN 800, profile 2A. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: DN 800, profile 2A according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Polymer concrete pipe, ID 800 mm, outer diameter 987 mm, wall thickness 74 mm, 476 kg/m, 2300 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aefe5508-e355-49b9-becf-dd0d79928404.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
